posture it is distributed under the European Union Public Licence v. 1.2 (the
full text is in the LICENSE file beside this notice).

Distribution note (the two-wasm split):
This crate compiles into its OWN artifact — `geofield_kernel.wasm` — which is the
ONLY place its compiled code appears. The sibling `geofield` crate (BSD-3-Clause)
does NOT link or embed this crate in its WebAssembly build; it reaches this
kernel's field oracle across a WebAssembly module boundary (runtime imports), so
`geofield.wasm` contains none of this EUPL-covered code. The two are separate
works combined only at load time by the host, each governed by its own licence.
